        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicon tetrahydride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicon tetrahydride, at plant
The multioutput-process "trichlorosilane hydrogenation delivers the co-products tetrachlorosilane  and silicon tetrahydride The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: a469a0d3-098b-31e9-afbe-2823897b3182
Trichlorosilane hydrogenation including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Disproportionation of trichlorosilane
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are estimated from a similar process.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a469a0d3-098b-31e9-afbe-2823897b3182.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
